{"id":"3K","title":"Compassion and Sympathy","part":{"n":3,"title":"Relationship to Other Persons"},"url":"/law/03-relationship-to-other-persons/3k","entries":[{"id":"3K.1","text":"We are exhorted to sympathize with other Christians.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"15"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"25-27"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:15; 1 Cor 12:25- 27; 1 John 3:17."},{"id":"3K.2","text":"Having compassion can make a difference.","refs":[{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Jude 1:22."},{"id":"3K.3","text":"We should exercise compassion and pity towards the afflicted.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":6,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":18,"verses":"33"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":2,"verses":"6-8"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Job. 6:14; Matt. 18:33; 2 Cor. 2:6-8; Heb. 13:3."},{"id":"3K.4","text":"Have compassion for the poor.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":19,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Prov. 19:17."},{"id":"3K.5","text":"Compassion and aid to be given to one that is found hurt and injured and robbed.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":10,"verses":"30-37"}],"citation":"Luke 10:30-37."},{"id":"3K.6","text":"Have compassion and pity for one another.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"1 Pet 3:8."},{"id":"3K.7","text":"Be merciful, just as your Father is merciful.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":6,"verses":"36"}],"citation":"Luke 6:36."},{"id":"3K.8","text":"Show mercy and compassion everyone to his brother.","refs":[{"book":"Zechariah","chapter":7,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Zech. 7:9."},{"id":"3K.9","text":"To him that is afflicted, pity should be shown from his friend.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":6,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Job 6:14."}]}